/**
 * @defgroup MIDILAR_BuildGuide_Platforms Platform Presets
 * @ingroup MIDILAR_BuildGuide
 * @brief Public MIDILAR presets backed by pinned RoModularBuild profiles.
 *
 * MIDILAR provides native Windows, macOS, and Linux presets plus AVR-GCC and GNU
 * Arm Embedded profiles. The public preset names and `MIDILAR_*` options live in
 * this repository. Compiler, generator, and generic cross-toolchain mechanics
 * are inherited from the pinned `tools/RoModularBuild` submodule.
 *
 * A preset is usable only when the required compiler toolchain and a compatible
 * Foundation package or source fallback are available. See
 * @ref MIDILAR_Workflows_SharedInfrastructure for the ownership boundary.
 */
